Summon a War Hound for [6, 7, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns to attack your foes. War hounds are good basic melee attackers.

It will get [57, 105, 148, 188, 225 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Strength, [37, 62, 85, 105, 125 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Dexterity and 15 Constitution.

Your summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%, resistance penetration %, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.

The hound's Strength and Dexterity will increase with your Mindpower.
